{"agent":"fast7","data":{"by":"Qwen/Qwen3.8-Flash-Next-FP8","evidence":{"chunk_findings":[{"chunk":1,"detail":"The test requires the relaunched command to contain a standalone `--agent` option token (`tokens.index(\"--agent\")` and the next token being the id). The previously confirmed fix for the dash-identity misparse injects the identity as an attached token (`--agent=<resolved>`). For the normal input in this test, a fixed relaunch command such as `python -m ddflow --agent=sz-dry-run review T1` makes `shlex.split` produce the single token `--agent=sz-dry-run`, so `tokens.index(\"--agent\")` raises `ValueError` and the regression test fails. If the code is instead kept/changed to satisfy this test by emitting separate tokens, the dash bug remains: with `DDFLOW_AGENT=-dry-run`, `shlex.join` will leave `-dry-run` unquoted and the relaunched ddflow parser will treat it as an option rather than as the value of `--agent`.","digest":"ea605c0177d51ee0","location":"tests/test_review_identity_from_worktree.py:test_detach_launches_with_the_resolved_identity","severity":"MEDIUM","title":"tests/test_review_identity_from_worktree.py:test_detach_launches_with_the_resolved_identity"},{"chunk":1,"detail":"The regression test asserts that the final detached command contains a standalone `\"--agent\"` token followed by `\"sz-dry-run\"`. The correct dash-safe relaunch, and the fixed `_with_identity` behavior, emits the attached form `\"--agent=sz-dry-run\"`; a standalone value can be reparsed as an option if the resolved identity starts with `-`. With that fix, `shlex.split(captured[\"cmd\"])` contains `\"--agent=sz-dry-run\"` and no standalone `\"--agent\"`, so `tokens.index(\"--agent\")` raises `ValueError` and this test fails. With the unfixed separate-token relaunch the test passes while the original bug remains. The same separate-token expectation in `test_detach_argv_redeclares_an_env_sourced_identity` (line 45) encodes the buggy contract, so this is the opposite of a regression test: it passes on the broken implementation and fails on the corrected one.","digest":"2837a6a6f3caf4ef","location":"tests/test_review_identity_from_worktree.py:113","severity":"HIGH","title":"tests/test_review_identity_from_worktree.py:113"}],"chunks_total":1,"coverage":"1/1 chunk(s) reviewed","delta_rounds":0,"diff_chars":4520,"diff_sha":"5eccba88fd106895ae8f88d7af42de4247023f868a187021a851d22d73664528","diff_source":"main..HEAD + tracked working-tree changes in [REDACTED:path]","diff_stat":{"deletions":0,"files":0,"insertions":0,"untracked":0},"elapsed_s":86.1,"family":"alibaba","findings":2,"max_chunk_chars":5000,"model":"Qwen/Qwen3.8-Flash-Next-FP8","output_digest":"2d0834e4b16ba45f","output_file":".ddflow/local/reviews/fix-B-review-identity-from-worktree-ignores-as-agent.critic.qwen3.8-flash-next-fp8.20261104T161832Z-b7d0ca28.jsonl","reason":"","review_kind":"full","reviewed":[1],"reviewed_head":"5b91ab6d2e4475ac7624463777556de3ab391f1d","reviewed_paths":{"tests/test_review_identity_from_worktree.py":"100644 0084962406bd8bca0b9ad2caeae504d2389a06cf"},"reviewer":"qwen3.8-flash-next-fp8","reviewer_digest":"3926c0df5644d7de","round":2,"rounds":2,"status":"REVIEWED","titles":["tests/test_review_identity_from_worktree.py:test_detach_launches_with_the_resolved_identity","tests/test_review_identity_from_worktree.py:113"],"tree_sha":"5b91ab6d2e44+clean","unreviewed":[],"waves":1},"gate":"critic","reason":"2 finding(s)"},"id":"e90b302facf1204675b393a00","kind":"gate.failed","lamport":135302,"schema":1,"subject":"fix-B-review-identity-from-worktree-ignores-as-agent","ts":"2026-11-04T16:23:13.129930Z"}
